# Local AI-client config + mweft backups (created in-repo by the launcher/installer).
# Anchor to repo root: a bare `CLAUDE.md` also matches the SHIPPED prompt template
# src/k2g/ui/templates/CLAUDE.md, which hatchling then drops from the wheel (the
# build honors .gitignore even for force-tracked files) → the installer's
# load_template() FileNotFoundErrors at runtime. Only ignore the root copy.
/CLAUDE.md
.mcp.json.mweft-bak
